@host = http://localhost:5290

### Criar (Name é aparado; NIF normalizado para 001234567)
POST {{host}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " Ana Silva ", "taxNumber": "001.234.567", "type": "CUSTOMER", "email": "ana@example.com", "creditLimit": 5000.50 }

### Obter por Id (substituir)
GET {{host}}/api/partners/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar com filtros combinados
GET {{host}}/api/partners?search=ana&type=CUSTOMER&includeInactive=false&page=1&pageSize=20

### Pesquisa por NIF (separadores ignorados)
GET {{host}}/api/partners?search=001.234

### Atualizar / desativar (Version obrigatória, vinda da resposta anterior)
PUT {{host}}/api/partners/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Silva", "taxNumber": "001234567", "type": "BOTH", "email": null, "creditLimit": 6000, "isActive": false, "version": "AAAAAAAAB9E=" }

### Erro 400: CreditLimit com três casas decimais
POST {{host}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Teste", "taxNumber": "123456789", "type": "CUSTOMER", "creditLimit": 10.999 }

### Erro 400: Page inválida
GET {{host}}/api/partners?page=0
